ed within \"Selling, general and administrative expenses\" on the Condensed Consolidated Statements of Income (Loss). Payments during the period primarily relate to amounts accrued in prior periods as well as charges incurred during the quarter.\nBalance at start of year $ 1,321\nCharges 23,226\nPayments (23,427)\nBalance as of July 3, 2026 $ 1,120\n"}
